      "writtenOn": "2025-09-18T15:02:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having thought about it a bit more its probably fine. The overall change to to_rust_string could probably be included as a separate patch instead. Just thought about it in order to avoid having to refactor more later down the line.",
      "parentUuid": "e8bce1c0_9f83f66b",
      "revId": "86858a78eb95f6672d0095a680610b8451552cb5",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
