      "writtenOn": "2025-09-18T15:21:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We cannot put the other method on NSString since it relies on the HostObject which is only be used in subclasses.\n\nWe could implement a dummy method on NSSstring that must be overridden (and currently is) within the private subclasses.\n\nCould also just move this down into the subclasses and duplicate it (does not really make sense).\n\nHowever, neither of these really need to be done anytime soon.  This is not a breaking change in any way that could cause a regression, it only corrects an issue that already exists in a way with as little duplication as possible.",
      "parentUuid": "e8bce1c0_9f83f66b",
      "revId": "86858a78eb95f6672d0095a680610b8451552cb5",
